{
  "_about": [
    "What a student reads for each kind of change, end to end.",
    "Each case is two publications' session rows, the builder API entry that",
    "diff_sessions -> _api_entry makes of them, and the line describeChange",
    "must print for that entry. tests/test_change_wording.py checks the rows",
    "still produce the entry; tests/js/change-wording.test.js checks the entry",
    "still produces the line. On 12 Nov 2026 the API started sending",
    "'weeks_changed' and the builder had no wording for it; with this fixture",
    "either side drifting fails its own suite.",
    "After a deliberate change to _api_entry, regenerate the entries with",
    "`uv run --group test python -m tests.test_change_wording --write`",
    "review the diff. The lines are written by hand."
  ],
